<title>SINGAPORE: Advanced Systems Auto half-year net up.</title>
<headline>Advanced Systems Auto half-year net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.90 vs  3.19</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (cts)   5.44 vs  3.85</p>
<p>    Turnover				48.71 vs 36.57</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     7.75 vs  5.41</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     0.58 vs  0.45</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	  2.07 vs  1.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 5.09 vs  3.51</p>
<p>    Tax					0.04 vs  0.35</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (loss) 0.16 vs  0.03 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Full name Advanced Systems Automation Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
